# Whitelist approach: ignore everything at root, then re-include source/config
/*
!/.gitignore
!/*.uproject
!/*.sln
!/*.vsconfig
!/Source/
!/Config/
!/Books/

# Unreal Engine generated / cache folders (in case they slip in under kept dirs)
**/Binaries/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/.vs/

# Build logs
*.log

# IDE junk
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.opendb
*.suo
